@prefix tkg: <https://zomer2001.github.io/rag_prepare/ontology/tkg#> .
@prefix rt: <https://zomer2001.github.io/rag_prepare/ontology/research-technology#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://zomer2001.github.io/rag_prepare/ontology/research-technology> a owl:Ontology ;
  owl:imports <https://zomer2001.github.io/rag_prepare/ontology/tkg-core> ;
  owl:versionInfo "0.1.0" .

rt:Person a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Entity .
rt:Organization a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Entity .
rt:Location a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Entity .
rt:ResearchObject a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Entity .
rt:Method a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf rt:ResearchObject .
rt:Model a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf rt:ResearchObject .
rt:Dataset a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf rt:ResearchObject .
rt:Material a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Entity .
rt:Device a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf rt:ResearchObject .
rt:Concept a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Entity .
rt:Program a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Entity .
rt:Contract a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Entity .

rt:ReleaseEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .
rt:DeploymentEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .
rt:ContractEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .
rt:PartnershipEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .
rt:InvestmentEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .
rt:TestEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .
rt:CorrectionEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .
rt:RetractionEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .
rt:TerminationEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf tkg:Event .

rt:develops a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain rt:Organization ; rdfs:range rt:ResearchObject .
rt:uses a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:range rt:ResearchObject .
rt:evaluates a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:range rt:ResearchObject .
rt:trainedOn a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:range rt:Dataset .
rt:produces a owl:ObjectProperty .
rt:participatesIn a owl:ObjectProperty .
rt:partnersWith a owl:ObjectProperty ; a owl:SymmetricProperty .
rt:locatedAt a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:range rt:Location .
rt:replaces a owl:ObjectProperty .
rt:supports a owl:ObjectProperty .
rt:contradicts a owl:ObjectProperty .
